<!--
  The app itself is ONE url, deliberately. ShotLab is a single-page app whose
  views are hash routes; a crawler discards everything after the #, so listing
  them would be listing the same page several times. The docs under /docs/ are
  working notes rather than pages written for a reader.

  /terms/, /privacy/ and /contact/ ARE listed. They are real pages with their
  own pre-rendered content, and a legal document that cannot be linked to or
  indexed is of no use to a regulator, an app-store reviewer, or anyone who
  wants to send somebody the policy.
-->
